<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<title>Studio — Ourlet</title>
<meta name="description" content="Ourlet's studio is one room on the fourth floor of a 1920s shirt factory in Mile End, Montreal, where four people cut, sew and mend every piece.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Studio — Ourlet">
<meta property="og:description" content="Ourlet's studio is one room on the fourth floor of a 1920s shirt factory in Mile End, Montreal, where four people cut, sew and mend every piece.">
</head>
<body>
{% render 'header' %}
<main class="bg-base-100 text-base-content">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-5 pt-16 pb-16 md:px-8 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-20">
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="type text-base-content/70">Studio 405 · 5590 Avenue de Gaspé · Mile End</p>
      <h1 class="page-title mt-5 max-w-[14ch]">One room, four people, a long table</h1>
    </div>
    <figure data-pleat class="mt-12 aspect-[4/3] bg-neutral md:aspect-[16/8]"><img src="/media/studio-table.jpg" class="size-full object-cover" data-print></figure>
  </section>
  <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-[90rem] gap-12 px-5 pb-24 md:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:pb-32">
    <div class="space-y-5 lg:col-span-6" data-reveal>
      <p class="type text-base-content/70">The story</p>
      <h2 class="heading">From Chabanel Street to the fourth floor</h2>
      <p class="body-text">Margaux Tessier spent nine years cutting coats and shirts for the garment factories of Chabanel Street, forty at a time, for labels she never met. In 2019 she rented one room on the fourth floor of a shirt factory built in 1920, set up a long table under its tall windows, and started Ourlet.</p>
      <p class="body-text">The building still has its freight elevator and the marks of the old cutting tables in the floor. We cut on the same spot, one piece at a time, when someone asks for it: nothing is made to sit in a stockroom, and nothing we make goes unsold.</p>
      <p class="body-text">Four of us work here now. We make two collections a year, keep three pieces in the Uniform, and mend everything we have ever made.</p>
    </div>
    <blockquote class="self-center border-l border-primary pl-8 lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8" data-reveal>
      <p class="statement text-[clamp(2rem,3.2vw,2.75rem)]">“I spent nine years cutting clothes nobody had asked for. Now I only cut the ones somebody has.”</p>
      <footer class="type mt-6 text-base-content/70">Margaux Tessier, founder</footer>
    </blockquote>
  </section>
  <section class="pattern-paper bg-base-100">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-5 py-24 md:px-8 lg:py-32">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="type text-base-content/70">How a piece is made</p>
        <h2 class="heading mt-3">From paper to parcel</h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="mt-14">
        {%- for step in data.making %}
        <li class="grid items-center gap-8 border-t border-base-300 py-12 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-10" data-reveal>
          <div class="md:col-span-3">{% render 'pattern-piece', shape: step.pattern, class: "block h-52 w-auto" %}</div>
          {% if step.image %}<img src="{{ step.image }}" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover md:col-span-4" data-print>{% endif %}
          <div class="md:col-span-4 md:col-start-9">
            <p class="type text-base-content/70">{{ step.step }}</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-[2.25rem]">{{ step.title }}</h3>
            <p class="body-text mt-3">{{ step.text }}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="bg-base-100">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-5 py-24 md:px-8 lg:py-32">
      <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-end" data-reveal>
        <div class="lg:col-span-6">
          <p class="type text-base-content/70">The cloth</p>
          <h2 class="heading mt-3">Five cloths, and where they come from</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="body-text max-w-md lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9">We buy from mills we have visited, and from the jobbers of Chabanel when a good roll turns up.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="mt-14 grid gap-x-6 gap-y-12 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5">
        {%- for cloth in data.fabrics %}
        <li data-reveal>
          <div class="bg-base-200 p-4 pb-5">
            {% if cloth.swatch %}<img src="{{ cloth.swatch }}" class="aspect-square w-full object-cover" data-pinked="all" data-print>{% endif %}
            <p class="type mt-4 font-bold">{{ cloth.name }}</p>
            <p class="type">{{ cloth.origin }}</p>
            <p class="type text-base-content/70">{{ cloth.weight }}</p>
          </div>
          <p class="body-text mt-4 text-[0.9375rem]">{{ cloth.text }}</p>
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="border-t border-base-300 bg-base-100">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-5 py-24 md:px-8 lg:py-32">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="type text-base-content/70">The people</p>
        <h2 class="heading mt-3">Who sews your piece</h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-12 md:gap-x-6 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {%- for person in data.team %}
        <li data-reveal>
          {% if person.photo %}<img src="{{ person.photo }}" class="aspect-[3/4] w-full object-cover" data-print>
          {% else %}<div class="flex aspect-[4/3] w-full items-center justify-center bg-base-200" aria-hidden="true"><span class="font-heading text-[clamp(3.5rem,8vw,6rem)] leading-none text-primary">{% assign words = person.name | split: " " %}{% for w in words %}{{ w | slice: 0 }}{% endfor %}</span></div>{% endif %}
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-[1.75rem]">{{ person.name }}</h3>
          <p class="type mt-1 text-base-content/70">{{ person.role }}</p>
          <p class="body-text mt-3 text-[0.9375rem]">{{ person.text }}</p>
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="pattern-paper bg-secondary text-secondary-content">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[90rem] items-center gap-12 px-5 py-20 md:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:py-28">
      <img src="/media/mending.jpg" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover lg:col-span-6" data-print>
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8" data-reveal>
        <p class="type">Mended for life</p>
        <h2 class="heading mt-3">We mend what we make</h2>
        <p class="body-text mt-5">Send back anything we made, from any year: a split seam, a worn elbow, a lost button. Repairs are free for two years and at cost after that, and the piece comes back within a month.</p>
        <p class="body-text mt-4">Write to us first with a photo; we send a prepaid label within Canada.</p>
        <a href="mailto:studio@ourlet.ca?subject=A%20repair" class="btn btn-outline mt-8 border-secondary-content">Ask for a repair</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
{% render 'footer' %}
</body>
</html>
